cache/
out/
broadcast/
# Anchored: only Foundry's dependency directory at the project root, not any nested src/lib.
/lib/
.env
data/allowlist.json
# Deployment records are TRACKED — deployments/mainnet.json and deployments/testnet.json are the
# shared record three services have to agree on, and a file that is not in the repository cannot be
# that. They hold addresses only; no key, no RPC URL, no secret of any kind.
#
# The exception is the local one. `script/deploy.sh local` rewrites it on every run against a
# throwaway chain, so it is an artifact of a run rather than a record of a deployment — the same
# reason broadcast/ is ignored above.
/deployments/local.json
